yUIWidgetized" data-resource-type=3D"discussion_topic.reply" data-resource-=
id=3D"2300526"><p>I chose to write about the assembly instructions. Specifi=
cally for the shade but there seems to be many people finding issues with a=
ssembly instructions for various furniture and household items.<br><br>The =
lack of any text in the images was the most frustrating. Additionally the c=
hanges in camera perspective from step to step make the instructions diffic=
ult to follow. This resonated with me due to past experience building furni=
ture where the instruction writers failed to use plain English to describe =
steps that are difficult to follow visually. Specifically I remember after =
putting a desk together I stepped back and noticed a panel on the drawer wa=
s installed backwards and did not match the other side.&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;=
The main lesson I got from this was to think about how my instructions appe=
ar to people who do have not a deep understanding of the topic. If I spent =
everyday working on the furniture, the instructions might seem a lot easier=
 to understand. Without this consideration for the end user we can introduc=
e unnecessary confusion.</p></span></div><span dir=3D"ltr" data-testid=3D"p=
ost-message-container" class=3D"css-1pu4tqw-view--block"><div dir=3D"ltr" c=
