</ol>
<p><span>I have received instructions very similar to this from Wayfair in =
the past, so I can definitely relate to the recipient's frustration. I have=
 had frustrations with diagrams that aren't specific enough about which pie=
ces are used. If that weren't enough, what is the writer trying to say in t=
he written instructions? While I understand that English must not be the wr=
iter's first language, it seems that the manufacturer would like for Englis=
h speaking readers to be able to understand the instructions.&nbsp;</span><=
/p>
<p><span>2. How can you use the lesson from this frustrating user help to w=
rite better user help yourself?</span></p>
