int=3D"https://uah.instructure.com/api/v1/users/72193/files/9936773" data-a=
pi-returntype=3D"File"></p>
<p>1) I think the most frustrating part of the user help in the tweet is th=
at it's for pills. It doesn't mention what kind of pills these are, but wit=
h most any type of medication, it's usually important to read about what yo=
u are putting into your body. The thing that resonates with me the most is =
that people are going to want to read this information because there could =
be serious warnings about their health, but since the information is so lon=
g and confusing, it's going to be very hard to read. I have had a similar e=
xperience with medications. Most of the time, they come with long instructi=
ons and warning pages that are very clumped together and difficult to read =
or not reader-friendly.</p>
<p>2) I think I will be able to use this lesson to condense my writing, esp=
ecially when working with documents. This can help with resumes or cover le=
tters in highlighting the most important material that I want my audience t=
o notice.</p></span></div><span dir=3D"ltr" data-testid=3D"post-message-con=
