<p><span class=3D"post_mention">1. This example resonated with me the most =
since I frequently find myself confused by poor cooking instructions. Befor=
e I began this discussion post, I was struggling to understand the directio=
ns on the back of the Mac &amp; Cheese I was making due to a similar issue.=
 If buyers struggle to read the instructions, they may be less likely to pu=
rchase the product again.</span></p>
<p>2. The only thing preventing these directions from being perfect is the =
placement of the first step. Like many others, I typically go step by step =
when following cooking instructions, so I would have missed it completely. =
Understanding this would prevent mistakes such as the one above. In the fut=
ure, I will make sure to read my directions through the eyes of their targe=
t audience.</p></span></div><span dir=3D"ltr" data-testid=3D"post-message-c=
